Apple is set to unveil new iPhone 18 Pro and iPhone 18 Pro Max models on <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/apple-september-2026-what-to-expect/">Wednesday, September 9</a>, and the devices are expected to feature a design that's largely similar to the iPhone 17 Pro models, with a peppering of enhancements inside. Major changes are not expected until next year, when Apple is expected to introduce a radically redesigned 20th-anniversary iPhone.<br/>
<br/>
